Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 06:34:06 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Virtual amiibo: ModelInfo in the console's layout, not
 the tag's

nn::nfp::ModelInfo is character ID (big-endian), variant, series, numbering ID
(little-endian), figure type, tag type. The raw tag bytes put the figure type
where games read the series and byte-swapped the numbering ID: Ocarina of Time
(main+0x326b518/+0x326b5f4) saw every amiibo as series 00, rejected Daruk and
the other Zelda-series figures as unsupported, and could not match its two mask
figures by numbering ID; only its character rule (Link, Zelda, Ganon) worked.

(cherry picked from commit ff2b3948aada758f55939273bf2d27a8cdc71a5c)
